{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1000_p", "source_sha256": "c5c2892f8e8672e9726c9686dcb3599943bb7004d8fe4fa4724cad04c0717b23", "ja": "（今日はグラビア雑誌のタイアップ企画の撮影。\nやよいは『ドラゴン』に扮して撮ることになった）", "zh": "（今天是写真杂志联动企划的拍摄日。弥生要扮成“龙”进行拍摄。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1001_005yay", "source_sha256": "81592fca0c3ffc267f9d7eee02ca2e001e0328669443dea6f0dc7b6922e32e98", "ja": "あ、{$P$}！\n……ど、どうですか？　私、強そうに見えますか？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n……怎、怎么样？我看起来很强吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1002_p", "source_sha256": "f258130174ff1fe9a05a0c79b8c0aa87ec5586ac26515cf88003d39e16ab900f", "ja": "ああ、バッチリだ。衣装もよく似合ってるよ。あとは\nもうちょっとドラゴンらしさが出せたら完璧だな！", "zh": "啊，非常棒。衣服也很适合你。要是还能再多表现出一点龙的感觉，就完美了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1003_005yay", "source_sha256": "58f162448df2d5e53f461b70f8631af168a10e3c766bfa1f13bee9ef45660a16", "ja": "ドラゴンらしさ！　えっと、じゃあ……\nかしこそうに鳴いてみる、とかですかね？", "zh": "龙的感觉！呃，那就……\n试着叫得聪明一点之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "d9f82464296cbd83e896e1bfcf742b88694d7843e0d5ceebba00a553f163b3b6", "ja": "ドラゴンって、すごーく長い時間を生きていて、\nとっても頭がいいって、資料に書いてありましたから！", "zh": "资料上写着，龙能活非常非常久，\n而且特别聪明！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1005_p", "source_sha256": "b83b394bfa0d4f5aba70e43ffa7f1865743af0d3abfa710e025d197fa45f8b1e", "ja": "賢そうに鳴くか……。作品によっては、\n人間の言葉を喋ることもあるし、できなくはないかな。", "zh": "叫得像很聪明吗……有些作品里还会说人话，应该也不是做不到。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1006_p", "source_sha256": "1a815a338a171f9f67ee9ff859512e10f0a0215c26636785ae990ca4918c3ad9", "ja": "何か、これまでのドラゴンが言ってこなかったような\nことを、鳴き声で表現してみるとか？", "zh": "要不要试着用叫声表达一些至今为止的龙都没说过的话？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1007_005yay", "source_sha256": "31ad00e17a0abdd98aece4e7901b779c6131b4d3a3dea49725840d9d019a06ac", "ja": "わかりましたっ！　ぎゃお～ん！\n柿食えばぁ～鐘が鳴るなりぃ～、ほう、りゅう、じー！", "zh": "我知道了！嗷呜～！\n柿熟～钟声晚～，法、隆、寺——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1008_p", "source_sha256": "334f94b74afe57a4cb292de198d135fef135c351bfe056ed2a36330f11079e76", "ja": "おお、そう来たか……。ドラゴンが俳句を詠んでも、\nあんまり賢そうじゃないかな……。", "zh": "哦，原来你是这么来的啊……就算龙来吟诵俳句，好像也不怎么显得聪明……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1009_005yay", "source_sha256": "1873c96a97b8782b0401cd8c498314d5679b2e120a7565776f949ed27c0e97b4", "ja": "ううっ、ごめんなさい～。\nかしこいドラゴン、私、へたっぴみたいです……。", "zh": "呜呜，对不起～\n聪明的龙，我好像不太擅长演……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1010_p", "source_sha256": "48b007a7a5ccf9bc06868218bb0aa7483598ead420d2ee5bcc20773d48f5f482", "ja": "そんなことはないぞ。よし、別のアプローチにして\nみよう！　やよいの賢い得意技を活かしてな。", "zh": "才不是那回事。好，那就换个方法试试吧！利用弥生聪明又擅长的本领。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1011_005yay", "source_sha256": "becd817e7a1cb2cf9dc9536803ec3ba4a8b3eebf38a6377b8ce07f02f8ca4693", "ja": "かしこい得意技？　私にそんなのないですよー？", "zh": "聪明的拿手绝活？我没有那种东西啦——？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1012_p", "source_sha256": "fec4dd40af42b40c7f8d7340912d98ef109e523695d1501fd0e7442506dde11e", "ja": "大丈夫、ちゃんとあるよ。さて、突然ですが！\n1890円のお肉が特売で3割引き……いくらだと思う？", "zh": "没问题，你当然有。那么，事出突然！\n1890日元的肉特价打3折……你觉得是多少钱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1013_005yay", "source_sha256": "62af669b25395c64e641129416add50e4097d3a7cc4d48b75807bd885213b205", "ja": "はい！　答えは1323円です！\n……うーん？　これが、私の得意技ですか？", "zh": "是的！答案是1323日元！\n……嗯？这就是我的拿手好戏吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1014_p", "source_sha256": "ba07f8925ec1f42e61cdab1b9a60ae8403cf163646fee16d078d54950a6f51fc", "ja": "そうだよ。大人でもすぐ答えられる人は多くない。\nこれは立派な特技だし、超ウルトラ賢いぞ！", "zh": "没错。就算是成年人，也没多少人能马上答出来。\n这可是很了不起的特长，而且你超级聪明！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1015_005yay", "source_sha256": "f2fb0b2ba2d591792c7d3877bd1d5289947288df4a4e0931f220395082caa003", "ja": "……！　えへへ。でも今のでわかりました！\nもっと自然に、そのままやればいいのかもーって。", "zh": "……！　诶嘿嘿。不过听您这么一说我就明白了！\n我想或许只要更自然、保持原样去做就好啦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_005yay0643_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_005yay0643_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "38aa346527ef195b00047f9046bb3ea016aa4d40341117c2ada87a4fd922250c", "ja": "私、なんだかやる気がもりもり出てきましたー！\nこの調子で本番も頑張りまーすっ！　ぎゃおお～～ん♪", "zh": "我感觉干劲满满的——！\n就保持这个势头，正式演出也要加油——！　嗷呜～～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
